  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cdb3c4aad0fcb53cee0c5445d7a2dad8e20bb230_0.webp\" alt=\"Jaden的下界拓展\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fThatJadenXgamer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/41e8a5f48e8d948883dd1ccff292ab19d9f292d2.png\" alt=\"推特 / X\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/y9zpxHeQuC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c903b0317e14abb041077f10cec1e3c9813ed91.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fJaden-s-Nether-Expansion-5e297f08f3514b8287ebffb527f318a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cbc419c446866c89930d3d292cad7b6fd9284ff1.png\" alt=\"JNE 维基\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jadens-nether-expansion/files/6729020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a9a7c91d8999f2f0addb167f97be4480d44dba8d.png\" alt=\"下载 JNE Forge版\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a2475e1dc950bd380a4814c3e8ebc3fcc45a6a61.png\" alt=\"关于\"></p><p><strong>Jaden的下界拓展</strong> 是一个原版友好型模组，旨在全面拓展下界维度，不仅添加了各种全新内容，还重制了现有原版概念。该项目持续成长并不断更新，准备好迎接有史以来最大的下界模组吧。</p><p>它最初只是一个简单的材质包，如今已发展成为Forge 1.20.1+平台上的完整模组。</p><p>如有任何疑问，请加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/y9zpxHeQuC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a></p><p><strong>或查阅 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fJaden-s-Nether-Expansion-5e297f08f3514b8287ebffb527f318a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基百科</a> 获取模组的完整文档</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.notion.so%252fJaden-s-Nether-Expansion-5e297f08f3514b8287ebffb527f318a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1111833/description_a992a26a-ea57-429e-8c1b-226778aaab4e.png\" alt=\"维基\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a611311d689ba4a3725c28f29575553b27d86a7c.png\" alt=\"依赖项\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elysium-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1111833/description_cd557a59-af44-44ba-91d7-6ee66c8cdc2d.png\" alt=\"Elysium API\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/603cf9280a9882bd623ee6608592e6ca439568b1.png\" alt=\"路线图\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/79497d3bc91aaf3ca5dbf7fe44b830c7dcb23890_0.webp\" alt=\"JNE路线图\"></p><p>Jaden的下界拓展持续更新中，目前仅完成了整体内容的1/8！我将更新所有5个原版生物群系，并额外添加4个全新生物群系</p><p>每个生物群系都将拥有独特的方块、物品、生物、游戏机制及更多内容！</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/11590b90cdf1650895af7e600a040cf17b2198ac.png\" alt=\"鸣谢\"></p><h3>贡献者：</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fBon_Exists\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ceasingbonsai17</a> - 贡献了菌光体、光孢及多个模组兼容材质</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH2eK7HVNIQZpDlGS9Ton3g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alganaut</a> - 制作了黑流浪者材质</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fludocrypt.bandcamp.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LudoCrypt</a> - 创作了蟋蟀音乐唱片</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaithfulpack.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Faithful</a> - 像素一致的岩浆怪材质取自Faithful 32x和64x</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Wawwior/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wawwior</a> - 协助修复了一些漏洞和问题</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fSydokiddo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sydokiddo</a> - 提议了\"Soul Slate\"的名称</p><h3>翻译者：</h3><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjuliusportfolio.carrd.co%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Julius</a> - 巴西葡萄牙语 [pt_br]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/0Starocean0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">0Starocean0</a> - 简体中文 [zh_cn]</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252foctagintaa%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">octaginta</a> - 土耳其语 [tr_tr]</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@sir_color\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SirColor</a> - 西班牙语 [es_es]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Wawwior/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wawwior</a> 与 ThatJadenXgamer - 德语 [de_de]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/AlexeyR2D2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AlexeyR2D2</a> 与 Linor - 俄语 [ru_ru]</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/AleXandr22/favorites\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sandro</a> - 意大利语 [it_it]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/unroman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">unroman</a> - 乌克兰语 [uk_ua]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Tamakii-2005\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EtherealTams</a> - 阿根廷西班牙语 [es_ar]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/TheDarkWatchernether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheDarkWatcher</a> - 波兰语 [pl_pl]</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/sunbatheproductions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">sunbatheproductions</a> - 日语 [jp_jp]</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3f5988a82c3d6604b6b28d775158ccbdce9150a2.png\" alt=\"问答\"></p><p><strong>问：Jaden的下界拓展还是数据包/资源包吗？</strong></p><p>答：不是，JNE已经彻底重做为Forge/NeoForge的原生模组。</p><p><strong>问：何时更新到X Minecraft版本？</strong></p><p>答：最终会更新，但目前没有具体时间表。</p><p><strong>问：会向后移植吗？</strong></p><p>答：不会。</p><p><strong>问：为什么Fabric版本被停止开发？</strong></p><p>答：在两个模组加载器上管理JNE这样庞大的项目变得过于费力。此外Fabric API本身功能不足，严重限制了该模组的发展。今后JNE将仅支持Forge/NeoForge。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff630fd2596dc2023e88baed49442e1e4f69d31b.png\" alt=\"分隔线\"></p>",
